    summary: "Good intentions need practical plans. This lesson studies 1 Corinthians 6:18-20, 2 Timothy 2:22, Proverbs 5:1-23, Matthew 5:27-30 and Psalm 119:9-11 to see the call to flee sexual immorality, to pursue righteousness with those who call on the Lord from a pure heart, the wisdom of staying away from the door of the adulteress, the radical measures Jesus urges against temptation, and the cleansing power of God's word.",
    scripture: ["1 Corinthians 6:18-20", "2 Timothy 2:22"], more: ["Proverbs 5:1-23", "Matthew 5:27-30", "Psalm 119:9-11"], memory: "Psalm 119:9",
