    summary: "This is the final examination week for the course. It draws questions from all twenty-four lessons: made for relationship, David and Jonathan, Jesus as friend, marks of a godly friend, choosing companions, bad company, loyalty, accountability, peer pressure, digital friendship, purity, courtship, marriage preparation, honest courtship, boundaries, heartbreak, singleness, mentoring, example, family, authority, loneliness and lifelong community.",
