    sa: ["In a few sentences, explain what makes a relationship godly.", ["love", "truth", "faith", "purity", "loyal", "christ"], "A good answer says a godly relationship is marked by love, truth, loyalty, purity and shared faith in Christ, with wise choices of companions, honest accountability, respect for authority and family, and welcome for others."],
